Set rrup, the rupture distance in the /magdist/ common block, to the distance read
(r). SMSIM leaves it unset (0) in this driver, but the Stafford (2022) spreading
(gsprd_optimal_stafford) and the Q operator with fr1 = -1 use it, so without
this the results for stafford.optimal_model.params are wrong. The loop drivers
set it.

--- a/gm_td_drvr.for
+++ b/gm_td_drvr.for
@@ -301,6 +301,7 @@
       
       write(*, '(a)') ' dist: '
       read(*, *) r
+      rrup = r
 
 !Replaced h_eff with f_ff
       rmod = rmod_calc(r, amag, 
